This software is an experimental concept and an educational work: a study
in how far a desktop stack can be rebuilt for performance and quality (a
Vulkan renderer, a Wayland client library, and software built on them,
such as non-commercial reimplementations of existing desktop clients). It
is shared for learning, research and non-commercial use, and will never be
offered for commercial use.

